# Keep the build context small and keep host state out of the image. artifacts/ holds the
# QLoRA adapter and dataset; .venv/ is a Windows virtualenv that would be useless and large
# inside a Linux image; .env holds real credentials and must never be baked in.
.venv/
.env
artifacts/
Datasets/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.git/
.github/
docs/
tests/
k8s/
terraform/
monitoring/
flink/
clickhouse/
scripts/
Vigil_Complete_Reference.md
*.sbatch
